> Now for a question or two. When I find a wand, and I do not have a
> spare scroll of identify, what are some safe ways to identify it?
> last time I zapped a grid bug and discovered my wand was a wand of
> polymorph. This was an effective way of identifying the wand but when
> the grid bug became a raven, the game ended quite abruptly.

The usual way is to write something on the ground with your fingers, 
then write something else at the same spot with your newly found wand. 
You'll usuall get a message that hints at the wand you've used. Three 
wands give the same message, though, and two others as well, while five 
wands don't give any message at all. Nevertheless, this gives a good 
indication what the wand does.

